SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added:

  - the two corrections: wildness moved from a race property to the Wildness
    stat, and the recipe worker's def lookup moved out of a static field
    initialiser into a [DefOf] class
  - the rewritten C# in Source/, which is a reimplementation against the 1.6
    API rather than a copy of the original assembly
  - the French translation
  - the packaging and the documentation

No mod icon ships. Art/Make-ModIcon.ps1, which cuts one from the mod's own
bunny sprite, is the port's work and is covered; the sprite it cuts is not.

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The dust bunny, the dust, their stats,
their balance and the four images are 2blockdude's and HendraGradeWood's work,
reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2659958183
  https://github.com/blockdude/csharp-rimworld-dust-bunnies

They never declared a licence for it, so none is granted here and none can be.
It is redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned mods - explicit
credit, a link to the original, and removal on request. About/Preview.png is
theirs as it stands.

If 2blockdude or HendraGradeWood asks for this to be taken down, it comes
down. Immediately, and without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
